{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（27日）上午10時許，筲箕灣道318號對開西行線路政署地盤有地底水管爆裂，大量水夾雜沙泥噴出，水花一度射上半空，黃泥水淹蓋行人路及來回行車線，途人及車輛須涉水而行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:22:20.981164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:47:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.828205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.828205+00:00","content_hash":"0f67a5d1ac266d99bd166ebffb0940f4ac5db7d4b84cf988b39c419d37727af0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}